# NestJS API (`apps/api`)

- Organize features as Nest modules (controllers, services, DTOs)
- Validate inputs with DTOs / class-validator (or project equivalent)
- **Prisma only here** — schema, client, and migrations stay in `apps/api`
- Auth: cookie + JWT session pattern; issue/verify sessions in the API
- Protect admin routes: `ADMIN` guards on `/api/admin/*`
- Frontends call this API; do not put business API logic in Next Route Handlers
